   466  c800 0201030b07120f15...Text0:	!scr "background colour written back to back", $ff
   467  c827 0f16051220140805...Text1:	!scr "over the screen: 32 pixel columns.", $ff
   468  c84a 0516051219203814...Text2:	!scr "every 8th line is a bad line: the vic-ii", $ff
